From: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:19:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 138/210] dt-bindings: sound: meson-aiu: add the HDMI S/PDIF
 output

The AIU can feed the HDMI controller from its IEC958 encoder as well as
from I2S. Add an identifier for that output.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
---
 include/dt-bindings/sound/meson-aiu.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/sound/meson-aiu.h b/include/dt-bindings/sound/meson-aiu.h
index 1051b8af298b..df045fe8136c 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/sound/meson-aiu.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/sound/meson-aiu.h
@@ -14,5 +14,6 @@
 #define CTRL_I2S		0
 #define CTRL_PCM		1
 #define CTRL_OUT		2
+#define CTRL_OUT_SPDIF		3
 
 #endif /* __DT_MESON_AIU_H */
